                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "•  Fix the weakest touch-points first: In-flight Wifi Service (2.81/5), Ease of Online Booking (2.88/5) and Gate Location (2.98/5).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#172334",
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "•  Protect In-flight Wifi Service - the single largest model driver - and keep it consistent across airports.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#172334",
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "•  Target Economy and personal-travel passengers (19% and 10% satisfied) with service recovery rather than blanket spend.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#172334",
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "•  Manage delays: delayed arrivals are only 36% satisfied versus 46% on time - invest in delay communication and recovery.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#172334",
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "•  Recognise the teams behind In-flight Service (3.64/5): they out-score the rest of the journey.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#172334",
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Computed from the project CSV outputs when the report was generated (full data set, not affected by slicers).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#5B6B82",
